  "releaseNotes": "Version 1.3.0 adds qBittorrent process info API support and refreshes package metadata.\n\n\t\t\t- Added ProcessInfo and ApplicationService.GetProcessInfo for /api/v2/app/processInfo.\n\t\t\t- Added ApiVersion.V2_15_1 for newer Web API compatibility checks.\n\t\t\t- Added copyright metadata and NOTICE references.\n\t\t\t- Updated Unix timestamp-backed properties to nullable DateTimeOffset?.\n\t\t\t- Aligned duration properties and converters around nullable TimeSpan?.\n\t\t\t- Fixed TimeSpan converter generic type mismatches for nullable duration serialization.\n\n\t\t\tNote: timestamp nullability changes may affect consumers that previously treated some timestamp properties as non-nullable.",
